            <ArticleTitle>Case report: a hazard caused by a lower partial denture.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>18</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Although dentures are cosmetic, as well as functional appliances, they can sometimes cause various oral conditions or life-threatening hazards to patients. A case is presented here of an unusual complication of a partial lower denture.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
